  "id": "haldol",
  "term": "Haldol",
  "definition": "Haldol is haloperidol, a drug with antipsychotic, neuroleptic, and anti-nausea effects. It works by blocking dopamine D2 receptors in the brain, which reduces dopamine signaling and can lessen delusions, hallucinations, and vomiting.",
